  "about_item": [
    "Portable Shower Kit for Pets: Bath your pets anywhere, without the need for fixed shower equipment or extended shower hose. There are no more venue restrictions. You can easily give a bath treatment to your dog in yard, indoor and outdoor camping. Let your dog enjoy the joy of bathing",
    "6000mAh Large Battery & Long Runtime: Rechargeable portable shower pump battery runs 120-150 mins after 3-hour full charge. One charge serves dogs of all sizes with no frequent recharging. Consistent water pressure helps with bathing tasks, avoids anxiety caused by battery issues when bathing pets outdoors",
    "IPX8 Waterproof & Anti-Clog Structure: IPX8 full waterproof for full immersion use. Anti-clog filter blocks hair and debris, easy to detach and clean. Non-slip base keeps pump steady, sealed chargin, port for longer service life",
    "Pet Friendly LED Display: Dog shower pump features an clearly LED display for a power status and water temperature. Outdoor shower kit From 32-140°F, you can keep pets safe while your pets enjoying bathing. Note: No heating function",
    "3-in-1 Multifunctional Dog Showerhead: Combining soft silicone dog bath brush, water spray rinser and massage function to remove loose hair, dirt and soap suds. Dog shower attachment soothes anxious pets and bring a enjoyable bathing. Ideal for daily cleaning and hair detangling",
    "Convenient Storage & Suitable for Any Occasions: Multi-use portable camping shower outdoor shower with a mesh organizer bag is ideal for Camping Essentials, Pet Washing, Kid's Baths, Car Cleaning and Plant Watering, among other uses and portability makes a great gift for outdoor enthusiasts"
  ],
