      {
        "position": 4,
        "title": "Well designed dog grooming wand",
        "text": "What makes this stand out from the many generic portable shower pumps is the dog shower wand. The silicone comb design lets me work the water down through the fur while gently massaging my dog at the same time. It helps rinse shampoo much better than a regular shower head and my dog seemed much more relaxed during bath time. The pump itself feels like the same style used on many portable camping showers but the quality is good for the price. The LED display is easy to read and showing both the battery level and water temperature is a nice feature even though it does not heat the water. The water pressure is steady and the anti clog filter is easy to remove for cleaning after dealing with pet hair. I also like the portability. The included storage bag keeps everything together and the rechargeable battery means I do not have to worry about cords while bathing outside. The IPX8 waterproof design adds confidence when using it around water and the non slip base helps with stability while the pump is running. It is also versatile enough for camping rinsing muddy boots washing the car or watering plants but the grooming wand is what really separates it from the many other portable shower kits on the market. Durability is mixed. Yes it’s strong for what it is but I wouldn’t neglect it at all. The materials are decent. I place it around consumer/ commercial grade. Overall I think it offers good value for money with good quality ease of use portability durability and compatibility for a variety of outdoor and pet care tasks.",
